<title>HUNGARY: Danubius Jan-Sept after-tax profit 2.27 bl.</title>
<headline>Danubius Jan-Sept after-tax profit 2.27 bl.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Jan-Sept 96	   Jan-Sept 95</p>
<p>    Group operating profit   2,073.4	 vs    1,485.4</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit     2,272.8	 vs    1,621.1</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit   2,272.8	 vs    1,621.1</p>
<p>    Group net sales	    7,690.7	 vs    5,530.4</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	   76.3	 vs	155.8</p>
<p>    Material expenditures    1,953.5	 vs    1,366.5</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures   2,033.3	 vs    1,618.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation		   486.5	 vs	277.1</p>
<p>    Other costs		    864.6	 vs	650.9</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   359.9	 vs	293.6</p>
<p>    Net financial income	  96.5 pft   vs     140.5 pft</p>
<p>     Financial revenue	   287.9	 vs	570.9</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure     191.4	 vs	430.4</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income   102.9 pft   vs	 4.8 loss</p>
<p>     Extraordinary revenue     136.0	 vs	  2.0</p>
<p>     Extraordinary expenditures 33.1	 vs	  6.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Danubius Hotels is a hotel group. The figures are consolidated.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
